      "content": "but that's just the thing... there isn't anything \"to create\" anymore. the whole point of those twenty years was the foundation, the stability, the life i was building. now the foundation is gone and im just left standing here in the middle of nothing. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting a life that's already over. why even bother trying to build something small when the big thing is dead? it just feels like i'm delaying the inevitable.",
